Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 01:07:31 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] niri-config: add parser for XDG shortcuts-spec triggers

The GlobalShortcuts portal asks the compositor to bind shortcuts using the
trigger format from the XDG shortcuts specification, e.g. "CTRL+ALT+T".
Add a parser that turns such a string into niri's Key type, plus a helper
that renders a key combination for humans.
